<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month bill yield rises to 20.09 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month bill yield rises to 20.09 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.09 percent, up from 19.75 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said. Full details of the auction follow, and on  HTBM.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	1,200.98 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.09 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.4289 pct</p>
</text>
